1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
She followed us home.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
The trail ended at some old ruins.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,200
Something was watching us.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,600
You don't fight it.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,000
It has a favourite snack.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,400
And then she trusted us.

7
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,000
Tart, stew or bun?
